unofficial fork identity

New build type "thorspan" = spantest (span defaults, debug signing) plus an
unofficial fork identity. The values are placeholders, change them for your own fork:
- applicationId io.github.example.wowspan, set with the variant API
  (androidComponents.onVariants) because a build type can only add an
  applicationIdSuffix; namespace stays app.gamenative.
- launcher label "WoW Span" (resValue app_name plus an appLabel manifest
  placeholder, so localized app_name strings don't show "GameNative").
- Settings info notice: "An unofficial fork of GameNative. Not affiliated
  with or supported by the GameNative maintainers."
- source-code link points at FORK_SOURCE_URL (empty here, falls back to the upstream link).
- update check and debug-report upload disabled.

Stock values live in defaultConfig (FORK_NOTICE / FORK_SOURCE_URL empty,
UPDATE_CHECK_ENABLED / DEBUG_REPORT_UPLOAD_ENABLED true, appLabel =
@string/app_name), so every other build type builds unchanged. Icon art is
unchanged.


---

